---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Accessibility" description="Accessibility statement for streisandeffect.org.">
  <section class="prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Accessibility</p>
    <h1>Accessibility statement</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      The archive aims to keep public pages readable, keyboard-accessible, and usable with assistive technology.
    </p>
    <p class="last-reviewed">Last updated: 2026-08-26</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section prose">
    <h2>Current approach</h2>
    <ul class="kicker-list">
      <li>Pages use semantic landmarks and a skip link.</li>
      <li>Navigation and links are keyboard-accessible with visible focus indicators.</li>
      <li>Body links are underlined and not identified by color alone.</li>
      <li>Long URLs, filenames, and checksums are allowed to wrap.</li>
      <li>The layout is designed to work at narrow viewport widths and high zoom.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="section prose">
    <h2>PDFs</h2>
    <p>
      The archive has not published a PDF accessibility assessment. If a PDF is inaccessible to you, please report the issue and identify the affected document.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section prose">
    <h2>Report an accessibility problem</h2>
    <p>
      Email: <a href="mailto:accessibility@streisandeffect.org">accessibility@streisandeffect.org</a>
    </p>
    <p>
      Include the URL, the problem encountered, the browser or assistive technology used if relevant, and the format you need.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
